# QA DoD-3 part 2: the app restarted on the profile of dod3_cup.script (same --user-data-dir, no
# deletion). Shows what persisted: progress on the main menu, settings (HUD 125 %, mph), the trophy
# and unlocked cups, unlocked cars, Toy Town's TT record and medal, and the saved ghost on the grid
# of a new Time Trial (driven by --autopilot).
#   cargo run -p recharged -- --user-data-dir target/qa/data/dod3 --window 1600x900 --autopilot \
#     --input-script tools/scripts/qa/dod3_restart.script --exit-after 400

wait ui
3.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 shot rst_01_main
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 shot rst_02_settings_gameplay
0.3 nav keyboardA back
1.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # Championship
2.0 shot rst_03_cup_select
0.3 nav keyboardA back
1.5 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Time Trial
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # Toy Town: record + medal
0.8 shot rst_04_tt_track_select
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 shot rst_05_tt_car_select
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
1.0 shot rst_06_tt_ghost_on_grid
wait racing
@180 shot rst_07_tt_ghost_racing
@360 tap keyboardA pause
wait paused
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quit race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
0.4 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait menu
1.5 exit
